{"parse": {"title": "TRC-16", "pageid": 6370, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/TRC-15\" title=\"TRC-15\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">TRC-16</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TRC</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">16</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.9A.86.E5.A4.A7.E6.AC.A2.E5.96.9C\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"皆大欢喜\">皆大欢喜</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 皆大欢喜</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">As We Like It</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>闹<span class=\"color-value\"></span>剧<span class=\"color-value\"></span>、<span class=\"color-value\"></span>胜<span class=\"color-value\"></span>利<span class=\"color-value\"></span>与<span class=\"color-value\"></span>雀<span class=\"color-value\"></span>跃<span class=\"color-value\"></span>欢<span class=\"color-value\"></span>呼<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span>尘<span class=\"color-value\"></span>埃<span class=\"color-value\"></span>落<span class=\"color-value\"></span>定<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>勇<span class=\"color-value\"></span>者<span class=\"color-value\"></span>也<span class=\"color-value\"></span>回<span class=\"color-value\"></span>到<span class=\"color-value\"></span>他<span class=\"color-value\"></span>温<span class=\"color-value\"></span>暖<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>家<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 1110116</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-zhantingnei.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"zhantingnei\"><img alt=\"zhantingnei\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/Cg-zhantingnei.png/600px-Cg-zhantingnei.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/Cg-zhantingnei.png/900px-Cg-zhantingnei.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/Cg-zhantingnei.png/1200px-Cg-zhantingnei.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪……汪汪！<i>&lt;等等……这其中存在着许多误会！&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪……汪汪！<i>&lt;冷静点朋友们……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">温迪：</div><div>汪汪——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪、汪汪汪……汪汪！<i>&lt;噢——别碰我的尾巴……眼镜也不行！&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安保犬：</div><div>汪汪～～汪～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪……<i>&lt;好吧，这确实是小狗们的胜利……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>呜呜……<i>&lt;他们看起来越发激动了……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>獒……汪汪汪——！<i>&lt;喂……理解、理解万岁！！&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>皮克勒斯的挣扎与求救声被淹没在愈发高涨的庆祝氛围里，英雄小狗被兴奋的人群簇拥在了最中心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>与物归原位的雷米特杯一起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-611201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>查尔顿恰到好处地清醒了过来，他仓促但积极地接受了这一现状。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"503501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-503501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-503501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"503501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-503501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-503501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-503501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-503501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">记者：</div><div>您好，请问您是这位英雄小狗的主人吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>不全是，但我是他的朋友……最要好的那一位。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"503501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-503501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-503501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"503501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-503501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-503501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-503501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-503501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">记者：</div><div>呃……请问您方便透露如此聪明的小狗是如何培养出来的吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"503501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-503501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-503501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"503501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-503501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-503501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-503501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-503501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">记者：</div><div>我想新闻登出之后，会有更多的朋友关心小狗平时的生活。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>唔……我常陪他欣赏一些交响乐，有时我们会一起探讨深刻的哲学问题……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>没错，我们家有着相当丰富的书籍藏品，比如《第一哲学沉思集》、《理想国》、《亚历山大修辞学》之类的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"503501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-503501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-503501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"503501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-503501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-503501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-503501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-503501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">记者：</div><div>……这是非常重要的第一手资料。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"503501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-503501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-503501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"503501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-503501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-503501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-503501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-503501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">记者：</div><div>谢谢您的合作，小狗主人先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>很高兴能接受你们的采访……皮克勒斯也是。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"503501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-503501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-503501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"503501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-503501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-503501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-503501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-503501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">记者：</div><div>那就好，后续我们可能会有进一步的报道需要您配合……源源不断的专访，电影拍摄，与英格兰足球队的友谊赛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"503501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-503501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-503501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"503501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-503501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-503501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-503501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-503501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">记者：</div><div>我想，除了关心新闻的观众们，英格兰足球队也一定希望当面感谢拯救世界杯荣誉的大英雄。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"503501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-503501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-503501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"503501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-503501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-503501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-503501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-503501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">记者：</div><div>小狗的英勇行为甚至极有可能受到电影投资商的青睐……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>真的——？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪，汪。<i>&lt;尽管我已经预见了这一切，但接受现实仍是一件相当困难的事。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪……<i>&lt;谁能救救我……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人类的悲欢并不相通，即使身处同一个展厅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>无人问津的另一侧，有人正向隅而泣。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-zhantingnei.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"zhantingnei\"><img alt=\"zhantingnei\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/Cg-zhantingnei.png/600px-Cg-zhantingnei.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/Cg-zhantingnei.png/900px-Cg-zhantingnei.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/Cg-zhantingnei.png/1200px-Cg-zhantingnei.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>流浪是我注定的宿命……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>在一场史无前例的、超乎想象的惊喜肥皂泡派对之后……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>人们居然没有留下任何一点关于美好世界的即兴创作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>甚至没有一个人提起过我的贡献……所有人都忽略了一个推动新时代的先驱——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>足以成为历史的伟大事件竟可笑地比不过一只小狗的吸引力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>啊……艺术已死。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>这是我所遇到的其中一个故事，《UTTU》的读者们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>它充满了戏剧性——误解——以及可爱动物与可怕的阴谋，又为我们带来了啼笑皆非的结局。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>我很高兴能把它讲述给你们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>无论你在哪儿，正在经历什么，希望它能带给你片刻的快乐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>我也由衷地期待着……你们的故事。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "TRC-16"}}